# Full database dumps stay out of the repo: they carry devices, alerts,
# caffeine logs and notifications. They live on the redmax disk instead
# (~/mnt/redmax/drinkwatch/repo-dumps). The curated barcodes dump is a data
# record the README points at, so only the gzipped pg_dump files are ignored.
backups/*.sql.gz
backups/*.dump
